{"version":1,"content":"<p></p><p>Apple限制 <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/guides/iphone-duo/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a> 訂單，限制每位顧客在美國、英國及其他地區最多購買兩部，原因是在預購開始後數分鐘內， <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/16/iphone-duo-pre-orders-now-backordered-to-next-year/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">出貨日期便延至</a> 明年1月，並在 <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/16/iphone-duo-now-available-to-pre-order-prices-start-at-1999/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">預購開始</a>。</p>\n<p>此舉似乎是為了處理炒貨問題，即有人大量買入供應緊張的裝置，再以遠高於零售價的價格在eBay轉售……</p>\n<a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/20/iphone-duo-orders-limited-to-two-per-customer-as-apple-tackles-scalping/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">more…</a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:03.767596+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"9to5Mac","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:05:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684441+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684441+00:00","content_hash":"cfd5c910edd169af788c39f4aa6747750bef7d9e24f4bc832654040b4cc55693","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}